st like rolling in loot um and he's  like i said he's kind of famous like in  certain circles and he's got this big  deal and he's going to be moving to  zurich in switzerland uh shortly so he  kind of wants to reconnect with all his  friends and family because it's kind of  going to be their last big weekend  together and he's going to be leaving  the country also uh unbeknownst to jane  because ryan hasn't told her  ryan has actually sold this family cabin  now he and jane spent a lot of time  growing up there as children like every  season they would go up there and she  really loved it uh we never actually do  get to meet jayne and ryan's parents uh  but neither twin really has much good to  say about them particularly their dad  apparently the dad like cheated on their  mom like all the time and lately has  been sort of gallivanting around the  globe with his much younger model  girlfriend who's like an italian or  something and hasn't really talked to  them or you know made any contact with  them or anything like that and you know  they're a little bit bitter about it  ryan especially now also invited up to  this kind of last hurrah which i think  is going to be like a four-day weekend  is sawyer now sawyer is ryan's best  friend since they were all teenagers and  also jane's first love and she's never  really gotten over him  she hasn't seen him in a few years i  think she's like she invited him to her  wedding but like he didn't show up and  so she doesn't really know like where  she stands on the situation and she's  kind of apprehensive about spending time  around him again uh though she's pretty  sure she can keep it together she's been  kind of like thinking about it her  brother keeps going are you all right  with this you know i wouldn't i i can  tell him not to come if you're gonna be  weird and she's like no no it's fine  now she doesn't know it's gonna be  difficult  especially since uh at the last minute  sawyer decided that he was going to  bring 